{#-
  Base email layout shared by every event-type template (T4.1).

  Styled to match the web design system: paper ground (#fafaf8), white card,
  ink text (#1b1b1f), and one accent — the calendar pen red (#c93b2b). Dates
  and countdowns render in monospace, like the app's countdown pills.

  Email-safe HTML: a single centred table, inline-friendly markup, and a
  ``<style>`` block that premailer (T4.2) inlines onto the elements at render
  time. Child templates override the blocks below; ``manage_url`` is rendered
  in the footer of EVERY email so an unsubscribe/preferences link is always
  present.

  Context placeholders (see T4.1): recipient_name, title, days_before,
  days_phrase, occurrence_date, message, manage_url.
-#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <title>{% block preview_title %}{{ title }}{% endblock %}</title>
    <style type="text/css">
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #1b1b1f;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        padding: 24px 0 36px 0;
      }
      .frame {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 16px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .brand-row {
        padding: 8px 8px 18px 8px;
      }
      .brand {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .brand-dot {
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .container {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 18px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid #e8e7e2;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 32px;
      }
      .pill {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 0 18px 0;
        font-family: Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #c93b2b;
        background-color: #faeae6;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 5px 14px;
      }
      .headline {
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        line-height: 1.25;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.4px;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .date-line {
        margin: 0 0 18px 0;
        font-family: Menlo, Consolas, "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #6d6d75;
      }
      .paragraph {
        margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #6d6d75;
      }
      .occasion {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .note {
        margin: 20px 0 0 0;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        background-color: #fafaf8;
        border-left: 3px solid #c93b2b;
        border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-style: italic;
        color: #1b1b1f;
      }
      .note-label {
        display: block;
        margin: 0 0 6px 0;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-style: normal;
        color: #c93b2b;
      }
      .footer {
        padding: 20px 8px 8px 8px;
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #9b9ba3;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #6d6d75;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="frame">
        <div class="brand-row">
          <p class="brand">wishly<span class="brand-dot">.</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content">
            <span class="pill">{{ days_phrase }}</span>
            <h1 class="headline">{% block headline %}{{ title }}{% endblock %}</h1>
            <p class="date-line">{{ occurrence_date }}</p>
            {% block body %}{% endblock %}
            {% if message %}
            <div class="note">
              <span class="note-label">Your note</span>
              &ldquo;{{ message }}&rdquo;
            </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          {% block footer_extra %}{% endblock %}
          <p>
            You&rsquo;re getting this because you track this date on Wishly.
            <br />
            <a href="{{ manage_url }}">Manage your reminders or unsubscribe</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
